  "title": "Resources to Support The Black Lives Matter Movement and Yourself",
  "summary": "In the current political climate, support for our community, staff, and customers remains a top priority for all of us at NaturAll Club. The struggles that face our community are large and ongoing, but through them all, we strive to encourage you and remind you that we are not just a brand, but a family. Here is a compiled list of ways in which you, and those around, can take action to create a real change as our country grapples with issues of police brutality and racial discrimination.",
